  "title": "Volcanic eruption halts flights at Indonesia's main international hub",
  "summary": "A volcanic eruption at Anak Krakatau in Indonesia disrupted flights at eight major airports, including Jakarta, and caused widespread evacuations, with operations halted for the first time since the 2018 eruption. The ash cloud caused damage across the region and led to two new eruptions.",
